{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an adventurer from an alien planet crash-lands on the continent of Votland, an unexpected journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant pixel world filled with dungeons, puzzles, crafting, and secrets as you uncover the truth behind the Void slowly consuming the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>nine large, hand-crafted dungeons</strong>\u2014each one not only a battlefield but a maze full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden chests, clever mechanisms, secret passages\u2026 only by using your wits and special abilities unlocked along the way can you <strong>solve every puzzle and uncover treasures</strong> meant only for true explorers. Every breakthrough delivers that satisfying \u2018aha\u2019 moment of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Philna Fantasy, combat isn\u2019t just about swinging swords, it\u2019s about defining <strong>your own playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: become a <strong>Berserker</strong> tearing through the battlefield, a <strong>Ranger</strong> picking off enemies from afar, a <strong>Chrono Mage</strong> controlling the flow of battle, or <strong>an Assassin</strong> striking from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has a <strong>deep skill tree</strong> that lets you mix and match abilities to create <strong>your own unique playstyle</strong>. Whether you seek hardcore challenges or a laid-back adventure, the <strong>four difficulty</strong> settings will pave the way for a journey that\u2019s both thrilling and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy <strong>replaying</strong> dungeons without the burnout! Monsters randomly drop gear of varying rarity, while materials <strong>collected</strong> inside can be used to <strong>craft</strong> equipment, socket gems, or brew potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This light yet engaging loop of collection and crafting will keep your growth journey exciting and full of anticipation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on the <strong>\u201cMagic Belt\u201d</strong>, developed by the Adventurers\u2019 Guild\u2014it\u2019ll be your smartest battle companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating monsters may drop unique materials used to unlock corresponding <strong>Magic Cards</strong>. Insert these cards into the belt to activate powerful effects, from boosting damage to improving exploration and unlocking special bonuses. Mix and match to create your own signature tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more adventuring alone! Set out with a variety of <strong>adorable pets</strong>\u2014they\u2019re not just company, but capable helpers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By raising affinity, each pet awakens unique support skills\u2014some excel in combat, others specialize in finding <strong>treasure</strong>. Bring them along and write your legends together\uff01<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a true adventurer, you take on not just tasks, but the trust and stories of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing <strong>various requests</strong> from the residents not only grants valuable rewards but also gradually unlocks hidden features in the game. Through the joys and sorrows of its people and changes in the environment, you\u2019ll deeply experience the culture, history, and undercurrents of truth across the continent of Votland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Struggle Against Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/dbc1ad26a052c4d350dd8df5e2c05ac597aa7955.jpg"},{"name":"Soul Reaper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/753bfcf3de4ed5e373e7fb9397ec15369845c153.jpg"},{"name":"Spark of Thought","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/1fac7c8445a4540f827b932cb4115fa82fc9409f.jpg"},{"name":"Chess Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/7742aa7d5f6a828a859b14f81bb2d3b10d2ed6b0.jpg"},{"name":"Path of Fury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/b94e1b399be93d72b1a071b8f5c4fb012a34a5a3.jpg"},{"name":"Hunter of the Winds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/f5f93fdc2d002546870e657efb8531adb768d298.jpg"},{"name":"Dance of Shadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/8f9ae5ef08abfbdeeaa403c4dfa7afadedf97cc3.jpg"},{"name":"Master of the Elements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/d0cf02c53a480395e2e85a707100d0e5287f412c.jpg"},{"name":"Forging Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/750394eced639fb720c1aa894fd55e60ec469967.jpg"},{"name":"Crafting Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2591150/a215c63df4e7706e162094fa41c3503cbc91a190.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2591150?t=1769742894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/bac298657af6d900ee2ededf315b3280a780764d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769742894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/e6d8a41d142a1b288161b91853261ede31cb3866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769742894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/e6d8a41d142a1b288161b91853261ede31cb3866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769742894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3344980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/81348e2f1ff065826f4b57c16cdaa0ca.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an adventurer from an alien planet crash-lands on the continent of Votland, an unexpected journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant pixel world filled with dungeons, puzzles, crafting, and secrets as you uncover the truth behind the Void slowly consuming the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/00aefee6e087e72d0cc3780caf29e662.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>nine large, hand-crafted dungeons</strong>\u2014each one not only a battlefield but a maze full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden chests, clever mechanisms, secret passages\u2026 only by using your wits and special abilities unlocked along the way can you <strong>solve every puzzle and uncover treasures</strong> meant only for true explorers. Every breakthrough delivers that satisfying \u2018aha\u2019 moment of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/2cc1a57e297cf49ff92bb0753255ad97.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/bd629e89a50f4f500b4e26feb66fcd90.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Philna Fantasy, combat isn\u2019t just about swinging swords, it\u2019s about defining <strong>your own playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path: become a <strong>Berserker</strong> tearing through the battlefield, a <strong>Ranger</strong> picking off enemies from afar, a <strong>Chrono Mage</strong> controlling the flow of battle, or <strong>an Assassin</strong> striking from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has a <strong>deep skill tree</strong> that lets you mix and match abilities to create <strong>your own unique playstyle</strong>. Whether you seek hardcore challenges or a laid-back adventure, the <strong>four difficulty</strong> settings will pave the way for a journey that\u2019s both thrilling and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/ac40f5355ee6b76a985efb4b286b4f51.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/46e6bfc032a3e07b4d6d01ebcad9bf61.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy <strong>replaying</strong> dungeons without the burnout! Monsters randomly drop gear of varying rarity, while materials <strong>collected</strong> inside can be used to <strong>craft</strong> equipment, socket gems, or brew potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This light yet engaging loop of collection and crafting will keep your growth journey exciting and full of anticipation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/4d8ce8d189741a3ea20366cbf704c104.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/346d44e2ea400ec43384ebc26a1d7f9e.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap on the <strong>\u201cMagic Belt\u201d</strong>, developed by the Adventurers\u2019 Guild\u2014it\u2019ll be your smartest battle companion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating monsters may drop unique materials used to unlock corresponding <strong>Magic Cards</strong>. Insert these cards into the belt to activate powerful effects, from boosting damage to improving exploration and unlocking special bonuses. Mix and match to create your own signature tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/cd056806c28231de0d27fc2681a7a0b0.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/20754f64593b0d81c48b08cc182b5ae0.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more adventuring alone! Set out with a variety of <strong>adorable pets</strong>\u2014they\u2019re not just company, but capable helpers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By raising affinity, each pet awakens unique support skills\u2014some excel in combat, others specialize in finding <strong>treasure</strong>. Bring them along and write your legends together\uff01<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/8924ed473efb0e4d52e19c0f57dc15d1.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/9fe1899049b01e0041b7e09be162629e.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a true adventurer, you take on not just tasks, but the trust and stories of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing <strong>various requests</strong> from the residents not only grants valuable rewards but also gradually unlocks hidden features in the game. Through the joys and sorrows of its people and changes in the environment, you\u2019ll deeply experience the culture, history, and undercurrents of truth across the continent of Votland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.poster.avif?t=1769742894\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.webm?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/extras/443e81c2c7c4d0cb5e725bd0b6337b84.mp4?t=1769742894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Sailike Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591150/31f9a5fd53a161b8a5efafa4674c1a0a5a82742e/header.jpg?t=1769742894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.11 El Capitan<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2591150/1931827413/39fee2a60eec6cde043be66bf416ddb6cf169a27/1768451416/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768460338","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2591150/1931827413/39fee2a60eec6cde043be66bf416ddb6cf169a27/1768451416/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768460338","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2591150/1931827413/39fee2a60eec6cde043be66bf416ddb6cf169a27/1768451416/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768460338","id":257265083,"name":"Release trailer","thumbnail":"http