 back against the invading shadow.","steam_appid":2591150,"support_info":{"email":"abjiasteamwork@163.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, German, Russian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"https://space.bilibili.com/58849889"}